landing.title = API request logs
landing.heading = API request logs
landing.intro = Use this service to review API request logs for applications on the HMRC API platform.
landing.youCan = You can:
landing.bullet.1 = see Making Tax Digital for Income Tax Self Assessment endpoint usage by application, client and month
landing.bullet.2 = identify failing endpoints and the error codes behind them
landing.bullet.3 = drill into individual requests and their raw log lines
landing.bullet.4 = import log files or pasted log lines in the HMRC API platform logback format
landing.startButton = Start now

